{"id":"fourmis","lemma":"fourmis","pos":"noun","rank":4564,"glosses":["pins and needles"],"ipa":"/fuʁ.mi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-fourmis.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-fourmis.wav.mp3","gender":"f","examples":[{"text":"Nous avons des fourmis dans la cuisine.","en":"We have ants in the kitchen.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"kitchen"}]},{"text":"Il veut se débarrasser des fourmis.","en":"He wants to get rid of the ants.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to clear"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Les fourmis ont-elles des oreilles ?","en":"Do ants have ears?","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"ear","l":"oreille"}]},{"text":"J’ai des fourmis dans la jambe.","en":"I've got pins and needles in my leg.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"leg"}]},{"text":"Le gâteau grouillait de fourmis.","en":"The cake was crawling with ants.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"a sponge cake"},{"g":"to mill about","l":"grouiller"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}